<title>JAPAN: Kobe Steel to issue 5 bln yen unsecured bonds.</title>
<headline>Kobe Steel to issue 5 bln yen unsecured bonds.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Kobe Steel Ltd</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Sanwa Securities Co Ltd</p>
<p>FISCAL AGENT - Sanwa Bank Ltd</p>
<p>TYPE Unsecured bonds with advanced redemption clause</p>
<p>ISSUE NO  8			   AMT   5 bln yen</p>
<p>DENOMINATION OF BONDS 100 million yen</p>
<p>COUPON  1.965 percent from March 6, 1997 to March 5, 2002 and 3.0 percent from March 6, 2002 to March 5, 2004</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE  100 yen		MATURITY  5.Mar.04</p>
<p> PAY DATE 05.Mar.97		  INT PAY  5th of Mar/Sept</p>
<p> SIGN DATE			     SUB DATE 13.Feb.97</p>
</text>
